Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.76,0:00:26.08,EN,,0,0,0,,Sasha, you've waited a little bit for this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.76,0:00:26.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,萨沙 这一座你等了不少时候
