Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.84,0:00:29.36,EN,,0,0,0,,it's all yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.84,0:00:29.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,都交给你了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.36,0:00:30.48,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.36,0:00:30.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.48,0:00:34.00,EN,,0,0,0,,Very first thing I want to start off
