Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.00,0:00:35.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,就是谢尔顿
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.36,0:00:38.16,EN,,0,0,0,,Ben, you're you're an incredible player,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.36,0:00:38.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢尔顿 你是个了不起的球员
