Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.16,0:00:39.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,也是个了不起的人
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.44,0:00:41.28,EN,,0,0,0,,This was your first Grand Slam final,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.44,0:00:41.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,这是你第一次打大满贯决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.28,0:00:42.32,EN,,0,0,0,,but I already told you you're going
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.28,0:00:42.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,但我已经跟你说过
