Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.52,0:00:51.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,你总有一天会举起这座奖杯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.44,0:00:56.24,EN,,0,0,0,,Then I I want to thank I don't want
