Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.96,0:00:59.12,EN,,0,0,0,,to wish a congratul Sorry I can't talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.96,0:00:59.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,说声恭 抱歉我说不出话了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.12,0:01:00.80,EN,,0,0,0,,We played for four hours.
