Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.92,0:04:17.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,你们很多人才要
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.76,0:04:19.20,EN,,0,0,0,,at 4, 5 a.m.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.76,0:04:19.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,凌晨四五点才上床
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.20,0:04:20.32,EN,,0,0,0,,this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.20,0:04:20.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,就在今年
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.32,0:04:22.64,EN,,0,0,0,,I was two points away from losing
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.32,0:04:22.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,我差两分就输掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.64,0:04:23.36,EN,,0,0,0,,in the first round.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.64,0:04:23.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,第一轮那场球
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.36,0:04:24.80,EN,,0,0,0,,I'm very happy that I won that match
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.36,0:04:24.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,我很庆幸赢下了那场
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.80,0:04:26.32,EN,,0,0,0,,because it would have been a different
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.80,0:04:26.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,否则今天的结果
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.32,0:04:27.68,EN,,0,0,0,,outcome otherwise.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.32,0:04:27.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,就完全不一样了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.68,0:04:30.08,EN,,0,0,0,,And I want to thank the the ball boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.68,0:04:30.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,我想谢谢球童
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.08,0:04:31.92,EN,,0,0,0,,I want to thank the the people
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.08,0:04:31.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,想谢谢那些
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.92,0:04:33.04,EN,,0,0,0,,that were behind the scenes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.92,0:04:33.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,在幕后忙的人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.04,0:04:34.00,EN,,0,0,0,,I want to thank the drivers.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.04,0:04:34.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,想谢谢司机
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.00,0:04:34.72,EN,,0,0,0,,I want to thank everyone
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.00,0:04:34.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,想谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.72,0:04:35.76,EN,,0,0,0,,who works in the restaurant.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.72,0:04:35.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,餐厅里工作的每一位
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.76,0:04:36.08,EN,,0,0,0,,Everybody
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.76,0:04:36.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,所有
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.08,0:04:38.16,EN,,0,0,0,,who stayed up late just for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.08,0:04:38.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,为我们熬夜的人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.16,0:04:41.76,EN,,0,0,0,,And it's it's not it it's really appreciated
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.16,0:04:41.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,这些大家真的都看在眼里
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.76,0:04:43.12,EN,,0,0,0,,by everyone and I want to thank them
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.76,0:04:43.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,每个人都心存感激
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.12,0:04:46.36,EN,,0,0,0,,as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.12,0:04:46.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,也谢谢他们
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.32,0:04:54.24,EN,,0,0,0,,Then Eric, first year
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.32,0:04:54.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,还有埃里克 第一年
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.24,0:04:55.28,EN,,0,0,0,,as a tourn director.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.24,0:04:55.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,做赛事总监
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.28,0:04:56.88,EN,,0,0,0,,So, congratulations to you
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.28,0:04:56.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,恭喜你
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.88,0:04:58.96,EN,,0,0,0,,for putting up such an amazing event.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.88,0:04:58.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,办出这么好的一届
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.96,0:05:02.16,EN,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry it's the wrong winner
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.96,0:05:02.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,抱歉今年这个冠军归了我
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.16,0:05:06.96,EN,,0,0,0,,this this year but I yeah I I did my job
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.16,0:05:06.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,但我只是做了自己的本职
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.96,0:05:09.76,EN,,0,0,0,,but thank you very much and you
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.96,0:05:09.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,总之非常感谢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.76,0:05:22.64,EN,,0,0,0,,did amazing Craig for those of you
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.76,0:05:22.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,你做得很好 然后是克雷格
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.64,0:05:23.92,EN,,0,0,0,,that you don't know Craig Tiley
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.64,0:05:23.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,可能有人不认识克雷格·蒂利
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.92,0:05:24.72,EN,,0,0,0,,has been the tournament director
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.92,0:05:24.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,过去二十五年
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.72,0:05:27.76,EN,,0,0,0,,in the Australian Open for the past 25 years
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.72,0:05:27.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,他一直是澳网的赛事总监
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.76,0:05:30.48,EN,,0,0,0,,and he decided to move to New York.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.76,0:05:30.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,然后他决定搬来纽约
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.48,0:05:31.20,EN,,0,0,0,,Um,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.48,0:05:31.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.20,0:05:33.20,EN,,0,0,0,,which we as players were not very happy
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.20,0:05:33.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,我们这些球员其实不太乐意
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.20,0:05:34.00,EN,,0,0,0,,about because he made
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.20,0:05:34.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为正是他
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.00,0:05:35.36,EN,,0,0,0,,the Australian Open the best tournament
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.00,0:05:35.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,把澳网办成了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.36,0:05:36.48,EN,,0,0,0,,in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.36,0:05:36.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,世界上最好的赛事
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.48,0:05:39.28,EN,,0,0,0,,But from now on, I think the US Open
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.48,0:05:39.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,但从今往后 我觉得美网
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.28,0:05:40.48,EN,,0,0,0,,will probably be the best tournament
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.28,0:05:40.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,大概会变成
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.48,0:05:41.84,EN,,0,0,0,,in the world since you're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.48,0:05:41.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,世界上最好的 因为你来了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.84,0:05:45.76,EN,,0,0,0,,So, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.84,0:05:45.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.76,0:05:47.12,EN,,0,0,0,,Thank you for moving here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.76,0:05:47.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢你搬过来
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.12,0:05:49.60,EN,,0,0,0,,Thank you for being here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.12,0:05:49.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢你在这儿
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.60,0:05:51.20,EN,,0,0,0,,Move back to Australia for like 3 months
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.60,0:05:51.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,要不回澳大利亚待三个月
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.20,0:05:52.72,EN,,0,0,0,,and then come back end of January.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.20,0:05:52.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,一月底再回来
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.72,0:05:53.92,EN,,0,0,0,,That would be great.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.72,0:05:53.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,那就太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.92,0:05:56.88,EN,,0,0,0,,But no, it's it's really I think the best hire
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.92,0:05:56.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,说真的 我觉得这是
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.88,0:05:58.08,EN,,0,0,0,,that the USTA could have done
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.88,0:05:58.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,美网协会最成功的一次引进
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.08,0:05:59.60,EN,,0,0,0,,and well done for putting up
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.08,0:05:59.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,第一年就办出
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.60,0:06:03.80,EN,,0,0,0,,such an amazing event the first year.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.60,0:06:03.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,这么棒的一届 干得漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.68,0:06:10.40,EN,,0,0,0,,Then last but not least, the crowds.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.68,0:06:10.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,最后同样重要的 是观众
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.40,0:06:22.88,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know that that today 99.9%
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.40,0:06:22.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,我知道今天 99.9% 的人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.88,0:06:26.00,EN,,0,0,0,,of the player the people wanted Ben to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.88,0:06:26.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,都希望谢尔顿赢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.00,0:06:30.80,EN,,0,0,0,,So I'm very sorry first of all, but second it
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.00,0:06:30.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,首先很抱歉 其次
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.80,0:06:35.28,EN,,0,0,0,,was an an incredible atmosphere to play in.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.80,0:06:35.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,在这样的氛围里打球太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.28,0:06:36.00,EN,,0,0,0,,Even though I know
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.28,0:06:36.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,虽然我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.00,0:06:38.64,EN,,0,0,0,,that the crowd was against me,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.00,0:06:38.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,全场都不站在我这边
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.64,0:06:41.04,EN,,0,0,0,,the crowd was always incredibly fair
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.64,0:06:41.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,但观众始终非常公道
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.04,0:06:42.96,EN,,0,0,0,,and we as players, we appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.04,0:06:42.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,我们球员很感激这一点
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.96,0:06:44.16,EN,,0,0,0,,You guys brought the energy,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.96,0:06:44.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,你们带来了能量
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.16,0:06:45.20,EN,,0,0,0,,you guys brought the noise,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.16,0:06:45.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,带来了声浪
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.20,0:06:50.28,EN,,0,0,0,,and we really thank you guys for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.20,0:06:50.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,真的谢谢你们
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.48,0:06:57.76,EN,,0,0,0,,I think I talked enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.48,0:06:57.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得我说得够多了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.76,0:07:00.32,EN,,0,0,0,,So, thank you and see you next year.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.76,0:07:00.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢大家 明年见
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.32,0:07:02.86,EN,,0,0,0,,You're not done yet, Sasha.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.32,0:07:02.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,还没完呢 萨沙
